      {
        "id": 188180,
        "name": "bobbertoriley",
        "username": "bobbertoriley",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/bobbertoriley/{size}/1910_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-01-25T23:42:42.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hopefully we'll get a good clarification on Felicia's backstory in an episode for her, because it sounds like there's a few interpretations on when she took on the Legacy mantle.</p><p>I'm also curious on when/what caused her to trade the Legacy title for Beacon. I know in Tactics that she did it because her father is still Legacy, but does that mean the Young Legacy variant is from a different part of the Multiverse? Did she fight in the OblivAeon event, and if so, which identity did she use? Is Beacon exclusive to Tactics, or is she always destined to be Beacon?</p><p>Man, probably questions I should submit...:)</p>",
        "post_number": 24,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:14:06.980Z",
