        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/bluedarky/{size}/1975_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-01-26T01:42:56.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>In the timeline we see, Iron Legacy is the first time Felicia wears the costume, in the original timeline before Iron Legacy, I'd assume the fight against Blade in the mars base was the first time she fought alongside her father.</p>",
