      {
        "id": 188182,
        "name": "MindWanderer",
        "username": "MindWanderer",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mindwanderer/{size}/4816_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-01-26T03:00:58.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>My understanding:</p><ul>\n<li>Original timeline: Baron Blade kills Paul, Felicia becomes Legacy and beats him.</li>\n<li>Iron Legacy timeline: Baron Blade incapacitates Paul temporarily, Felicia becomes Legacy and is promptly killed, Paul goes nuts and kills Blade.</li>\n<li>Shattered timeline: Unclear. &nbsp;Next Evolution shows them both in costume in a non-hostile situation, so she at least starts wearing the costume at some point, probably when they go up against Iron Legacy. &nbsp;She most likely never calls herself Legacy, though.</li>\n</ul>",
