      {
        "id": 188183,
        "name": "The Burning Stickman",
        "username": "The_Burning_Stickman",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/the_burning_stickman/{size}/2003_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-01-26T05:49:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>She's not in costume in Next Evolution. She's just wearing a t-shirt that has a small Legacy logo on it. My guess is it depicts when Paul first found out about her powers.</p><p>Which is another question to ask -- does a Parsons get all the powers at once, or do they start with the previous generation's, then develop one later?</p>",
