      {
        "id": 188184,
        "name": "dpt",
        "username": "dpt",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dpt/{size}/1922_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-01-29T01:03:53.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>On another thread, @Powerhound2000 asked where Christopher and Adam talked about the Freedom Six. As a result, I ended up making a table of contents to help future people:</p><ul>\n<li>00:00 - Introduction</li>\n<li>03:50 - Parsons family overview</li>\n<li>07:39 - Particular Parsons, starting from Joseph Parsons to Paul Parsons VIII, the current Legacy</li>\n<li>17:27 - Start of the questions</li>\n<li>19:55 - DLo Lott's question on Mama Parsons and how she feels about the Legacies going around putting themself in danger</li>\n<li>22:30 - Senator Emily Parsons</li>\n<li>27:17 - Nielzabub: relations between Paul Parsons VIII and Pauline Felicia Parsons</li>\n<li>28:00 - crossing the streams</li>\n<li>32:35 - Chris Burton: Relation between Legacy and Iron Legacy, how time travel works</li>\n<li>around 35:10 - discussion of nature of Iron Legacy event&nbsp;(35:46: \"ousted from other world\")</li>\n<li>36:00 - Nielzabub question, how did relationship change as a result of Iron Legacy</li>\n<li>38:44 - David: Who does Legacy trust?</li>\n</ul><p>At this point i found what I was looking for. Someone else can fill this in more!</p>",
